msgctxt "577\t654"
msgid "You're younger than I expected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "678\t737"
msgid "And that is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "738\t887"
msgid ""
"Name's Date, with the Keihin News.\\n"
"I'm researching Suzuki's link with the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "937\t1042"
msgid "Ah, the famous detective turned reporter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164\t1223"
msgid "Can I offer you gentlemen a drink?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224\t1284"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1479\t1671"
msgid ""
"I hear you're running an orphanage\\n"
"on a piece of land earmarked for the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1690\t1750"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1755\t1922"
msgid ""
"Rumor has it, that's why Daigo Dojima\\n"
"backed out of the deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1950\t2010"
msgid "What's your point?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2015\t2201"
msgid ""
"My point is... our objectives\\n"
"in all of this are aligned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2243\t2303"
msgid "Meaning what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2588\t2711"
msgid "You want to put an end to the resort, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2725\t2787"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2799\t2983"
msgid "I, too, find that the most preferable outcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2984\t3090"
msgid "Wait, what? What are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3091\t3274"
msgid ""
"Without the resort, won't your\\n"
"military expansion bill be doomed to fail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3287\t3349"
msgid "It will, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3356\t3458"
msgid "However. That doesn't matter now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3459\t3537"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter?\\n"
"Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3538\t3591"
msgid "It's simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3592\t3747"
msgid ""
"I had no intention of\\n"
"passing that bill in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3748\t3808"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3901\t3961"
msgid "Explain yourself, Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3963\t4069"
msgid "Your military expansion bill, the resort deal..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4083\t4155"
msgid "We want to know everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4249\t4348"
msgid ""
"As long as you don't forget\\n"
"the favor I mentioned earlier."
msgstr ""